{title: Madhuban Khushboo Deta Hai}
{artist: Yesudas}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        Madhuban khushboo deta hai,
[A] [F],        saagar saawan deta hai
[Am],        Jeena uska jeena hai,
[A] [F],        jo auro ko jeewan deta hai
[Am],        Madhuban khushboo deta hai
[A] [D],        Suraj na ban paaye to,
[D] [A],        banke deepak jalta chal
[A] [D],        Phool mile ya angaare,
[D] [A],        sach ki raaho pe chalta chal
[G] [A],        sach ki raaho pe chalta chal
[Am],        Pyaar dilo ko deta hai,
[A] [F],        ashqo ko daaman deta hai
[Am],        Jeena uska jeena hai,
[A] [F],        jo auro ko jeewan deta hai
[A] [D],        Chalti hai lehraake pawan,
[D] [A],        ke saans sabhi ki chalti rahi
[A] [D],        Logo ne tyaag diye jeewan,
[D] [A],        ke preet dilo mein palti rahe
[G] [A],        ke preet dilo mein palti rahe
[Am],        Dil woh dil hai jo auro ko,
[A] [F],        apni dhadhkan deta hai
[Am],        Jeena uska jeena hai,
[A] [F],        jo auro ko jeewan deta hai
